OL,3,GNEWSAStudent claimed it was his        
OL,4,Abirthright to sit on Stone of Destiny  
OL,5,Aas he smashed exhibit                  
OL,7,FA French student who claims Scottish   
OL,8,Fheritage has admitted smashing the     
OL,9,FStone of Destiny exhibit with a hammer 
OL,10,Fwhile insisting it was his "birthright"
OL,11,Fto be allowed to sit on the stone.     
OL,13,FArnaud Hercules Harixcalde Logan, 36,  
OL,14,Fpleaded guilty to a charge of          
OL,15,Fmaliciously damaging the historic      
OL,16,Fartefact's glass casing at Perth Museum
OL,17,Fin July last year.                     
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
