OL,3,GNEWSAStudent claimed it was his        
OL,4,Abirthright to sit on Stone of Destiny  
OL,5,Aas he smashed exhibit                  
OL,7,FPerth Sheriff Court was shown CCTV     
OL,8,Ffootage which showed Logan using a blue
OL,9,Fand white hammer to strike the         
OL,10,Freinforced glass cabinet 24 times -    
OL,11,Fcausing #9,000 worth of damage.        
OL,13,FThe court was told the exhibition was  
OL,14,Fclosed to the public for three months  
OL,15,Fas a result of the incident.           
